<title>RUSSIA: St Petersburg 630-day muni yields 33.37 pct.</title>
<headline>St Petersburg 630-day muni yields 33.37 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised average yield on an issue of 630-day GGKO municipal bonds was 33.37 percent at an auction on Wednesday, general agent AVK said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction follow:</p>
<p>    Series number			     SU36002GSPM0</p>
<p>    Volume					100 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations			     100,000 rbls</p>
<p>    Bids (nominal)			    115.88 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Sold					   75.10 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Proceeds				     47.65 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Average price				63.45 pct</p>
<p>    Lowest accepted price		    63.22 pct</p>
<p>    Average yield				33.37 pct</p>
<p>    Highest accepted yield		   33.71 pct</p>
<p>    Tenor					  630 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date				Feb 10, 1999</p>
<p>--St Petersburg Newsroom, +7812 219 9209</p>
</text>
